#: 6441e3fc3850418f94c88a5d69a74023
msgid "GBD (GRAPHTEC Binary Data) is a proprietary format featuring:"
msgstr "GBD (GRAPHTEC Binary Data) は以下のような特徴を持つ独自形式です："

